Third-party components
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the source in this repository and nothing else.

FFmpeg. This application runs ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe as external programs
and expects to find them in bin/. Those binaries are NOT in this repository,
are not covered by the licence above, and are not distributed with this
source. The build this was developed against is a GPL build, and anyone
redistributing a packaged copy of this application with FFmpeg bundled inside
it takes on the obligations of FFmpeg's own licence (GPL v3 for that build).
Obtain FFmpeg from https://ffmpeg.org/ and read its licence before
redistributing anything that contains it.

Qt / PySide6 is used under the LGPL v3. numpy, Pillow and pydantic are used
under their own permissive licences.
